    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cursed School</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a catastrophic thunderstorm, an ancient curse descends, transforming Sakuradoki High School into a living hell. The awakened survivors gradually lose their sanity, their souls are devoured by desire and fear, turning them into bloodthirsty and brutal monsters...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parry, Slash and Survive!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Devourer is a metroidvania action-platformer with a striking anime horror art style. Explore the cursed Sakuradoki High School, master powerful abilities, battle twisted monsters, and uncover the long-buried dark secrets hidden beneath the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/c3c4f115c74ecd7ef1dddc90171ba841.avif?t=1746057609\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sekiro-inspired Parry System:\u00a0</strong>Actively parry enemy attacks, expose their weaknesses, and unleash a powerful counterattack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/1d4e22e52c6f4d01be8299e48228576b.poster.avif?t=1746057609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/1d4e22e52c6f4d01be8299e48228576b.webm?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/1d4e22e52c6f4d01be8299e48228576b.mp4?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Monsters:\u00a0</strong>Fight against over 70 twisted monsters, each with unique behaviors and attacks. And challenge over 10 ferocious bosses, exploit their weaknesses, defeat them and get unique abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/002ba8731843d2c95ae41646783f3c4e.poster.avif?t=1746057609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/002ba8731843d2c95ae41646783f3c4e.webm?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/002ba8731843d2c95ae41646783f3c4e.mp4?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Explore over 10 unique main areas in a vast, interconnected game world full of excitement. Also collect souls scattered around the game world, that allow you enhance your character, master new abilities, customise your gameplay and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/d0ec9818ddfb2b6451a79665cbf4197e.poster.avif?t=1746057609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/d0ec9818ddfb2b6451a79665cbf4197e.webm?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/d0ec9818ddfb2b6451a79665cbf4197e.mp4?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-buried Secrets:</strong>\u00a0Uncover the secrets buried deep beneath the school, encounter mysterious characters, collect a variety of clues, forge your path towards the truth of the ancient curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/dd774a495795f67b533399dd27e7d43c.poster.avif?t=1746057609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/dd774a495795f67b533399dd27e7d43c.webm?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/dd774a495795f67b533399dd27e7d43c.mp4?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cursed School</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a catastrophic thunderstorm, an ancient curse descends, transforming Sakuradoki High School into a living hell. The awakened survivors gradually lose their sanity, their souls are devoured by desire and fear, turning them into bloodthirsty and brutal monsters...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parry, Slash and Survive!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Devourer is a metroidvania action-platformer with a striking anime horror art style. Explore the cursed Sakuradoki High School, master powerful abilities, battle twisted monsters, and uncover the long-buried dark secrets hidden beneath the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/c3c4f115c74ecd7ef1dddc90171ba841.avif?t=1746057609\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sekiro-inspired Parry System:\u00a0</strong>Actively parry enemy attacks, expose their weaknesses, and unleash a powerful counterattack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/1d4e22e52c6f4d01be8299e48228576b.poster.avif?t=1746057609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/1d4e22e52c6f4d01be8299e48228576b.webm?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/1d4e22e52c6f4d01be8299e48228576b.mp4?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Monsters:\u00a0</strong>Fight against over 70 twisted monsters, each with unique behaviors and attacks. And challenge over 10 ferocious bosses, exploit their weaknesses, defeat them and get unique abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/002ba8731843d2c95ae41646783f3c4e.poster.avif?t=1746057609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/002ba8731843d2c95ae41646783f3c4e.webm?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/002ba8731843d2c95ae41646783f3c4e.mp4?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Explore over 10 unique main areas in a vast, interconnected game world full of excitement. Also collect souls scattered around the game world, that allow you enhance your character, master new abilities, customise your gameplay and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/d0ec9818ddfb2b6451a79665cbf4197e.poster.avif?t=1746057609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/d0ec9818ddfb2b6451a79665cbf4197e.webm?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/d0ec9818ddfb2b6451a79665cbf4197e.mp4?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-buried Secrets:</strong>\u00a0Uncover the secrets buried deep beneath the school, encounter mysterious characters, collect a variety of clues, forge your path towards the truth of the ancient curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/dd774a495795f67b533399dd27e7d43c.poster.avif?t=1746057609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/dd774a495795f67b533399dd27e7d43c.webm?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530620/extras/dd774a495795f67b533399dd27e7d43c.mp4?t=1746057609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
